OL,3,GNEWSAWe must save water as drought
OL,4,Abecomes new normal, says minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has warned action is
OL,7,Fneeded to prevent water shortages
OL,8,Fbecoming "the norm" after severe
OL,9,Fdrought was declared across parts of
OL,10,Fsouthern England.
OL,12,FWater and flooding minister Emma Hardy
OL,13,Ftold MPs current drought conditions
OL,14,Fwere "something we have not experienced
OL,15,Ffor decades" and urged people to "think
OL,16,Fabout ways to use water wisely over the
OL,17,Fcoming weeks".
OL,19,FSevere drought was declared across
OL,20,Fparts of southern England on Thursday
OL,21,Fafter months of low rainfall, with
OL,22,Faround 50 million people now impacted.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
